/S /P
/P 596 0 R
/ActualText (This routine can be applied using the printable spell it template found in printable resources. The student will fill in a circle for each sound heard, and then will proceed to fill in the letter or letters that represent those sounds in each box \(below the filled in circle\).)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
